# Agent Workflow Kit Protocol

Use this rule in projects that install Agent Workflow Kit.

Before editing:

- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py work --agent cursor`.

During work:

- Keep edits inside the task write scope.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py note "<short factual update>"` after each meaningful phase.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py refresh` after re-reading changed plan or rule files.

Before completion:

- Run task verification commands.
- Run `python3 tools/agentctl.py finish`.
